# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the process-level signal shutdown test.
# OpenSSL/libcrypto maintains global allocator bookkeeping during
# ConnectionPool::init (BIO_free/CRYPTO_* on the main thread). TSan reports
# these as single-thread races inside an uninstrumented third-party library;
# they are not races in muduo-chat code.
race:libcrypto.so
race:libssl.so
